# Excludes internal repo metadata from the Cloudflare Workers static-assets bundle.
# assets.directory in wrangler.jsonc is "." (repo root), so without this the build
# tries to upload .git itself as a servable asset -- including .git/objects/pack/*.pack,
# which grows past Workers' 25 MiB per-file limit as the repo picks up real commits and
# fails the entire deploy. None of this is ever meant to be served to a visitor anyway.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
*.md
sql
Articles
